\ Wrong twin (batch-g-wrong.lean's w_stale_target, review probe p01):
\ the split clears h, so the later rcases names nothing in the goal
\ (Lean's "Unknown identifier"), though its pattern, a name, would do
\ nothing with it. w-stale-blank.lf is the same with obtain's _ and x.
theorem w_stale_target
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b
  a b = b a = ∧ explicit: h
  b a =
:= by
  ' h by-obtain[ << hab hba >> ]
  ' h by-rcases[ x ]
  ' hba by-exact
end w_stale_target
